lanning @nutrition-need-vitamin-e-alpha-tocopherol-mg, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-need-vitamin-e-supplemental-mg, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-need-vitamin-k-phylloquinone-ug, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-need-water-g, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-need-zinc-mg, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-needs-bounds, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-needs-energy, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-needs-reference) { r_3EP111RS9CF6TTGX0C3G14FXWK
Follow @nutrition-needs-reference, @nutrition-needs-energy, then @nutrition-needs-bounds. Select targets before optimizing quantities. This source covers healthy adults aged 19–120, excluding pregnancy and lactation. Other populations require explicit personal or professional targets. References describe groups; they do not measure an individual requirement.
} r_3EP111RS9CF6TTGX0C3G14FXWK

Choose a reference (@nutrition-needs-reference: 0, #part-of @nutrition-needs, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-needs-energy) { r_4FZSRDNH431REV9ZYKS946FGX7
RDA is a planning target designed to cover nearly all healthy people in a reference group. AI is used when evidence cannot establish an RDA. UL is an applicable ceiling. AMDR constrains energy shares from macros. An absent ceiling means no established limit, not evidence that any dose is safe. Select the physiological reference group and age used by the source, then apply personal overrides.

[NIH reference definitions](https://ods.od.nih.gov/HealthInformation/nutrientrecommendations.aspx); [USDA calculator](https://www.nal.usda.gov/human-nutrition-and-food-safety/dri-calculator). Each extension retains its source and scope.
} r_4FZSRDNH431REV9ZYKS946FGX7

Estimate energy (@nutrition-needs-energy: 0, #part-of @nutrition-needs, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-needs-bounds) { r_62RP3CZY3TNA3BW65ZMA1JG3PA
Mifflin–St Jeor estimates resting energy: 10 × weight kg + 6.25 × height cm − 5 × age years + reference constant (+5 male; −161 female), in kcal/day. Multiply by an explicitly chosen activity factor for a rough daily planning estimate. The multiplier is a separate assumption. Inspect weight trend and performance; replace with measured or prescribed energy when available.

Protein and carbohydrate supply about 4 kcal/g and fat 9 kcal/g. Food composition energy can differ from these approximations. Daily requirements apply each day; multiplying by seven describes the week, not permission for an empty day.

[Original equation](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2305711/); [adult macro ranges](https://www.nationalacademies.org/cdn/materials/9fb9fae1-63a0-4048-88ad-3f972639149a).
} r_62RP3CZY3TNA3BW65ZMA1JG3PA

Apply nutrient bounds (@nutrition-needs-bounds: 0, #part-of @nutrition-needs, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-need-protein-g) { r_6RDTZXJJBTNA3BW08MWP2DENNB
A minimum can be absent; an absent maximum is unlimited. Equal bounds fix a quantity. Keep RAE, RE, retinol, DFE, folic acid, and supplemental quantities distinct. Units are g, mg, ug, or kcal per day; 1 g = 1000 mg and 1 mg = 1000 ug.

Missing, null, unavailable, and trace composition contribute zero, preserving their missing flag. If no selected food has measured iodine, a positive iodine target makes the model infeasible. Add measured composition or explicitly change the target; do not invent coefficients.

The `demeter.reference` extensions hold selection data with inclusive age intervals. Personal selected targets belong to a private plan.
} r_6RDTZXJJBTNA3BW08MWP2DENNB

Protein (@nutrition-need-protein-g: 0, #part-of @nutrition-needs, #nutrition-planning @nutrition-need-carbohydrate-by-difference-g) { r_6A2EXMR9M7XYW4XWNVWXTG9N88
